--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project DEPENDS ON third-party packages but VENDORS none of them. No
third-party source is copied into this repository, so no third-party license
terms attach to the distribution of this code. Dependencies are declared in
pyproject.toml and resolved at install time.

A license audit of the resolved dependency tree on 2026-09-25 found no
copyleft obligations affecting redistribution -- no GPL, AGPL, or SSPL. The
tree is predominantly MIT, Apache-2.0, and BSD. Two packages (certifi,
pathspec) are MPL-2.0, whose copyleft is file-scoped and is not triggered by
using them as unmodified dependencies. One transitive package
(text-unidecode) is Artistic/GPL dual-licensed; it is likewise used unmodified
and not redistributed here, but an adopter who vendors dependencies should
look at it directly rather than take this paragraph's word for it.

